<h3 data-start=3D"3236" data-end=3D"3280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3240" data-end=3D"3280">2.3 Bonnes pratiques pour <code data-start=3D"3268"=
 data-end=3D"3278">&lt;header&gt;</code></strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3281" data-end=3D"3700">
<li data-start=3D"3281" data-end=3D"3374" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3283" data-end=3D"3374" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
283" data-end=3D"3296">Placement</strong> : La balise <code data-start=3D"3=
309" data-end=3D"3319">&lt;header&gt;</code> doit =C3=AAtre plac=C3=A9e au =
d=C3=A9but de la page ou de la section.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3375" data-end=3D"3554" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3377" data-end=3D"3554" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
377" data-end=3D"3441">Utilisation de la balise <code data-start=3D"3404" d=
ata-end=3D"3411">&lt;nav&gt;</code> =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur de <code data-s=
tart=3D"3429" data-end=3D"3439">&lt;header&gt;</code></strong> : Il est cou=
rant d'utiliser une balise <code data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3488">&lt;=
nav&gt;</code> =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur de l'en-t=C3=AAte pour d=C3=A9finir =
la navigation principale.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3555" data-end=3D"3700" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3557" data-end=3D"3700" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
557" data-end=3D"3577">Ne pas en abuser</strong> : Si une page contient plu=
sieurs sections distinctes, chaque section peut avoir son propre <code data=
-start=3D"3669" data-end=3D"3679">&lt;header&gt;</code> pour plus de clart=
=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
