d=3D"3355">&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"3357" data-end=3D"3363">&=
lt;h3&gt;</code>, etc. ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3374" data-end=3D"3630" class=3D"">Les balises de titres s=
ont utilis=C3=A9es pour d=C3=A9finir des titres et sous-titres dans un docu=
ment HTML. Ces balises vont de <strong data-start=3D"3493" data-end=3D"3503=
"><code data-start=3D"3495" data-end=3D"3501">&lt;h1&gt;</code></strong> (l=
e plus important) =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3536"><cod=
e data-start=3D"3528" data-end=3D"3534">&lt;h6&gt;</code></strong> (le moin=
s important). Elles servent =C3=A0 structurer la hi=C3=A9rarchie de l'infor=
mation sur une page.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3632" data-end=3D"3663" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
632" data-end=3D"3661">R=C3=B4le des balises de titre</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3664" data-end=3D"3852">
<li data-start=3D"3664" data-end=3D"3720" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3666" data-end=3D"3720" class=3D"">Hi=C3=A9rarchiser le co=
ntenu en fonction de son importance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3721" data-end=3D"3773" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3723" data-end=3D"3773" class=3D"">Faciliter la lecture et=
 la navigation sur la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3774" data-end=3D"3852" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3776" data-end=3D"3852" class=3D"">Am=C3=A9liorer le r=C3=
=A9f=C3=A9rencement SEO en d=C3=A9finissant la structure des informations.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
