<h3 data-start=3D"1884" data-end=3D"1921" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1888" data-end=3D"1921">1.4 Formats d'images courants</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1922" data-end=3D"1967" class=3D"">Les formats d'images le=
s plus utilis=C3=A9s sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2141">
<li data-start=3D"1968" data-end=3D"2010" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1970" data-end=3D"2010" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
970" data-end=3D"1978">JPEG</strong> : Id=C3=A9al pour les photographies.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2011" data-end=3D"2065" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2013" data-end=3D"2065" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
013" data-end=3D"2020">PNG</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour des images avec tra=
nsparence.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2066" data-end=3D"2102" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2068" data-end=3D"2102" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
068" data-end=3D"2075">GIF</strong> : Pour des images anim=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2103" data-end=3D"2141" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2105" data-end=3D"2141" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
105" data-end=3D"2112">SVG</strong> : Format vectoriel =C3=A9volutif.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2143" data-end=3D"2171" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2147" data-end=3D"2171">1.5 Bonnes pratiques</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2529">
<li data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2269" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
174" data-end=3D"2198">Optimiser les images</strong> : R=C3=A9duire la tail=
le des images pour am=C3=A9liorer les temps de chargement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2433" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2433" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
272" data-end=3D"2304">Utiliser des formats adapt=C3=A9s</strong> : Choisis=
sez le format d'image en fonction du type de contenu (ex. JPEG pour les pho=
tos, PNG pour les images avec transparence).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2434" data-end=3D"2529" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2436" data-end=3D"2529" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
436" data-end=3D"2452">Balise <code data-start=3D"2445" data-end=3D"2450">a=
lt</code></strong> : Toujours inclure l'attribut <strong data-start=3D"2483=
" data-end=3D"2492"><code data-start=3D"2485" data-end=3D"2490">alt</code><=
/strong> pour l'accessibilit=C3=A9 et pour le SEO.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2534" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2536" data-end=3D"2627" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2539" data-end=3D"2627">Chapitre 2 : La Balise <code data-start=3D"2564" da=
ta-end=3D"2573">&lt;audio&gt;</code> - Ajouter de l'Audio =C3=A0 une Page W=
eb (Interm=C3=A9diaire)</strong></h2>
