</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4241" data-end=3D"4295" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4245" data-end=3D"4295">2.5 Bonnes pratiques pour les listes ordonn=C3=A9es=
</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4296" data-end=3D"4508">
<li data-start=3D"4296" data-end=3D"4428" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4298" data-end=3D"4428" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
298" data-end=3D"4321">Utilisation logique</strong> : Utilisez des listes o=
rdonn=C3=A9es lorsque l'ordre des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments est crucial, comme des=
 =C3=A9tapes d=E2=80=99un processus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4508" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4431" data-end=3D"4508" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
431" data-end=3D"4448">Accessibilit=C3=A9</strong> : Assurez-vous que chaqu=
e =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est clair et bien d=C3=A9fini.</p>
</li>
</ul>
