<h3 data-start=3D"799" data-end=3D"835" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"80=
3" data-end=3D"835">1.1 D=C3=A9finition d=E2=80=99un attribut</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"836" data-end=3D"1056" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=3D=
"839" data-end=3D"856">attribut HTML</strong> est une propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 q=
ui fournit des informations suppl=C3=A9mentaires =C3=A0 propos d=E2=80=99un=
 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment HTML. Il se place =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur de la balise d=
'ouverture de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment et se compose g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement de d=
eux parties :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1057" data-end=3D"1294">
<li data-start=3D"1057" data-end=3D"1140" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1059" data-end=3D"1140" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1062" data-end=3D"1083">nom de l'attribut</strong> (par exemple, <code =
data-start=3D"1098" data-end=3D"1104">href</code>, <code data-start=3D"1106=
" data-end=3D"1111">src</code>, <code data-start=3D"1113" data-end=3D"1118"=
>alt</code>, <code data-start=3D"1120" data-end=3D"1127">class</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1133">id</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1294" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1143" data-end=3D"1294" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"1146" data-end=3D"1170">valeur de l'attribut</strong>, qui est g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9ralement une cha=C3=AEne de caract=C3=A8res (par exemple, <code data-=
start=3D"1232" data-end=3D"1259">"https://www.example.com"</code>, <code da=
ta-start=3D"1261" data-end=3D"1274">"image.jpg"</code>, <code data-start=3D=
"1276" data-end=3D"1287">"myClass"</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1296" data-end=3D"1397" class=3D"">Les attributs HTML sont=
 utilis=C3=A9s pour personnaliser l=E2=80=99apparence ou le comportement de=
s =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments HTML.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"1399" data-end=3D"1443" class=3D"">Exemple de syntaxe d'u=
n attribut HTML :</h4>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"1444" data-end=3D"1509"><div=
