<h2 data-start=3D"5813" data-end=3D"5876" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5816" data-end=3D"5876">Chapitre 5 : Attributs Avanc=C3=A9s et Accessibilit=
=C3=A9 (Expert)</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5878" data-end=3D"5930" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5882" data-end=3D"5930">5.1 Attributs pour am=C3=A9liorer l=E2=80=99accessi=
bilit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5932" data-end=3D"5949" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5937" data-end=3D"5949"><code data-start=3D"5939" data-end=3D"5947">aria-*<=
/code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"5950" data-end=3D"6224" class=3D"">Les attributs <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5964" data-end=3D"5972">ARIA</strong> (Accessible Rich Interne=
t Applications) sont utilis=C3=A9s pour am=C3=A9liorer l'accessibilit=C3=A9=
 des applications web. Ces attributs permettent de fournir des informations=
 suppl=C3=A9mentaires aux utilisateurs de technologies d=E2=80=99assistance=
 (comme les lecteurs d'=C3=A9cran).</p>
<p data-start=3D"6226" data-end=3D"6254" class=3D"">Quelques exemples coura=
nts :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6541">
<li data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6339" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6257" data-end=3D"6339" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
257" data-end=3D"6273"><code data-start=3D"6259" data-end=3D"6271">aria-lab=
el</code></strong> : fournit un texte explicatif pour un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =
sans texte visible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6340" data-end=3D"6435" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6342" data-end=3D"6435" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
342" data-end=3D"6359"><code data-start=3D"6344" data-end=3D"6357">aria-hid=
den</code></strong> : indique si un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment doit =C3=AAtre ignor=
=C3=A9 par les technologies d=E2=80=99assistance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6436" data-end=3D"6541" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6438" data-end=3D"6541" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
438" data-end=3D"6453"><code data-start=3D"6440" data-end=3D"6451">aria-liv=
e</code></strong> : indique =C3=A0 une technologie d=E2=80=99assistance de =
surveiller les changements dans un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
</ul>
