<h3 data-start=3D"2908" data-end=3D"2947" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2912" data-end=3D"2947">2.2 Explication de la Structure</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2948" data-end=3D"3734">
<li data-start=3D"2948" data-end=3D"3034" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2950" data-end=3D"3034" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
950" data-end=3D"2962"><code data-start=3D"2952" data-end=3D"2960">&lt;html=
&gt;</code></strong> : C=E2=80=99est l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment racine du document=
. Il contient tout le contenu HTML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3035" data-end=3D"3213" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3037" data-end=3D"3213" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
037" data-end=3D"3049"><code data-start=3D"3039" data-end=3D"3047">&lt;head=
&gt;</code></strong> : Contient des m=C3=A9tadonn=C3=A9es sur la page comme=
 le titre, l'encodage des caract=C3=A8res, et des liens vers des ressources=
 externes (comme des fichiers CSS ou JavaScript).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3214" data-end=3D"3341" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3216" data-end=3D"3341" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
216" data-end=3D"3228"><code data-start=3D"3218" data-end=3D"3226">&lt;body=
&gt;</code></strong> : Contient tout le contenu visible de la page, comme l=
es sections, les titres, les paragraphes, les images, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3455" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3455" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
344" data-end=3D"3358"><code data-start=3D"3346" data-end=3D"3356">&lt;head=
er&gt;</code></strong> : Repr=C3=A9sente l'en-t=C3=AAte de la page, souvent=
 utilis=C3=A9 pour les logos, les titres, et la navigation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3456" data-end=3D"3550" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3458" data-end=3D"3550" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
458" data-end=3D"3469"><code data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3467">&lt;nav&=
gt;</code></strong> : Contient des liens de navigation, comme des menus ou =
des barres de navigation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3551" data-end=3D"3609" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3553" data-end=3D"3609" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
553" data-end=3D"3565"><code data-start=3D"3555" data-end=3D"3563">&lt;main=
&gt;</code></strong> : Contient le contenu principal de la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3610" data-end=3D"3734" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3612" data-end=3D"3734" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
612" data-end=3D"3626"><code data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3624">&lt;foot=
er&gt;</code></strong> : Contient le pied de page, souvent avec des informa=
tions de copyright et des liens vers des pages l=C3=A9gales.</p>
</li>
</ul>
