<h3 data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4309" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4263" data-end=3D"4309">3.2 Importance des Relations Parent-Enfant</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4310" data-end=3D"4537" class=3D"">Les relations parent-en=
fant sont importantes car elles d=C3=A9terminent l=E2=80=99ordre et le plac=
ement des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans la page, ainsi que l=E2=80=99impact de l'=
un sur l'autre en termes de style, de comportement, et d=E2=80=99accessibil=
it=C3=A9. Par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4538" data-end=3D"4831">
<li data-start=3D"4538" data-end=3D"4666" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4540" data-end=3D"4666" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"4543" data-end=3D"4561">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment enfant</strong> h=C3=A9rite s=
ouvent des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de style de son <strong data-start=3D"4608"=
 data-end=3D"4626">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment parent</strong> (comme les marges, les=
 couleurs, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4667" data-end=3D"4831" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4669" data-end=3D"4831" class=3D"">Si un <strong data-star=
t=3D"4675" data-end=3D"4693">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment parent</strong> a des propri=
=C3=A9t=C3=A9s sp=C3=A9cifiques (comme <code data-start=3D"4730" data-end=
=3D"4745">display: flex</code> ou <code data-start=3D"4749" data-end=3D"476=
9">position: relative</code>), cela peut affecter la disposition des <stron=
g data-start=3D"4810" data-end=3D"4830">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments enfants</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4836" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4838" data-end=3D"4903" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4841" data-end=3D"4903">Chapitre 4 : Hi=C3=A9rarchie des Balises Structurel=
les (Avanc=C3=A9)</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4905" data-end=3D"4955" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4909" data-end=3D"4955">4.1 La Hi=C3=A9rarchie des Balises de Structure</st=
rong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4957" data-end=3D"5136" class=3D"">Les balises HTML sont s=
ouvent organis=C3=A9es dans des structures hi=C3=A9rarchiques plus complexe=
s, en fonction du type de contenu et de la mani=C3=A8re dont il doit =C3=AA=
tre affich=C3=A9. Par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5138" data-end=3D"5531">
<li data-start=3D"5138" data-end=3D"5531" class=3D"">
