<h3 data-start=3D"3856" data-end=3D"3887" class=3D"">2.3 Types de s=C3=A9le=
cteurs CSS</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3889" data-end=3D"4233">
<li data-start=3D"3889" data-end=3D"3981" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3891" data-end=3D"3981" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
891" data-end=3D"3912">S=C3=A9lecteur de type</strong> : S=C3=A9lectionne t=
ous les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments d'un certain type (ex. : <code data-start=3D"397=
0" data-end=3D"3974">h1</code>, <code data-start=3D"3976" data-end=3D"3979"=
>p</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3982" data-end=3D"4071" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3984" data-end=3D"4071" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
984" data-end=3D"4007">S=C3=A9lecteur de classe</strong> : Cible les =C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments ayant une certaine classe (ex. : <code data-start=3D"4062" dat=
a-end=3D"4069">.menu</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4072" data-end=3D"4157" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4074" data-end=3D"4157" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
074" data-end=3D"4092">S=C3=A9lecteur d'ID</strong> : Cible un =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ment unique avec un identifiant (ex. : <code data-start=3D"4146" data-en=
d=3D"4155">#header</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4158" data-end=3D"4233" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4160" data-end=3D"4233" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
160" data-end=3D"4183">S=C3=A9lecteur universel</strong> : Cible tous les =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments d'une page (ex. : <code data-start=3D"4228" data-end=3D"=
4231">*</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4238" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4240" data-end=3D"4309" class=3D"">Chapitre 3 : Propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9s CSS et Mise en Page (Niveau Interm=C3=A9diaire)</h2>
