<h3 data-start=3D"5379" data-end=3D"5414" class=3D"">3.3 Positionnement des=
 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5416" data-end=3D"5518" class=3D"">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =
HTML peuvent =C3=AAtre positionn=C3=A9s de diff=C3=A9rentes mani=C3=A8res a=
vec les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s CSS suivantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5520" data-end=3D"5893">
<li data-start=3D"5520" data-end=3D"5574" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5522" data-end=3D"5574" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
522" data-end=3D"5545"><code data-start=3D"5524" data-end=3D"5543">position=
: static;</code></strong> : Positionnement par d=C3=A9faut.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5575" data-end=3D"5648" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5577" data-end=3D"5648" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
577" data-end=3D"5602"><code data-start=3D"5579" data-end=3D"5600">position=
: relative;</code></strong> : D=C3=A9calage par rapport =C3=A0 sa position =
normale.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5649" data-end=3D"5732" class=3D"">
