, ce qui r=C3=A9duit la duplication et la maintenance du code.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6351" class=3D"">3.3 L'importance des f=
rameworks CSS</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6353" data-end=3D"6686" class=3D"">Les frameworks CSS, com=
me <strong data-start=3D"6379" data-end=3D"6392">Bootstrap</strong> ou <str=
ong data-start=3D"6396" data-end=3D"6412">Tailwind CSS</strong>, offrent un=
e approche d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 structur=C3=A9e pour s=C3=A9parer le contenu et l=
