<ul data-start=3D"3655" data-end=3D"3680">
<li data-start=3D"3655" data-end=3D"3680" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3657" data-end=3D"3680" class=3D"">Sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9 :=
 <code data-start=3D"3671" data-end=3D"3680">0,1,0,0</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"3682" data-end=3D"3720" class=3D"">Comment calculer la sp=
=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9 :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3804" class=3D"">La sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=
=A9 est calcul=C3=A9e en attribuant des valeurs =C3=A0 chaque type de s=C3=
=A9lecteur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3806" data-end=3D"3990">
<li data-start=3D"3806" data-end=3D"3858" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3858" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
808" data-end=3D"3825">S=C3=A9lecteurs ID</strong> : ajoutent 100 =C3=A0 la=
 sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3859" data-end=3D"3917" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3861" data-end=3D"3917" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
861" data-end=3D"3885">S=C3=A9lecteurs de classe</strong> : ajoutent 10 =C3=
=A0 la sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3918" data-end=3D"3990" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"3990" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
920" data-end=3D"3959">S=C3=A9lecteurs d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments ou de balises</=
strong> : ajoutent 1 =C3=A0 la sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3992" data-end=3D"4018" class=3D"">Dans l'exemple ci-dessu=
s :</p>
