1" data-end=3D"4026">div</code> a une sp=C3=A9cificit=C3=A9 de <code data-s=
tart=3D"4048" data-end=3D"4057">0,0,0,1</code> (aucun ID, aucune classe, un=
 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4176" class=3D"">
