 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"759" data-end=3D"831" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"761" data-end=3D"831" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"761=
" data-end=3D"784">Les pseudo-=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments</strong> : styliser une pa=
