<hr data-start=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2591" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"2593" data-end=3D"2628" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2595" data-end=3D"2626">3. Les S=C3=A9lecteurs de Fr=C3=A8res</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"2630" data-end=3D"2680" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2633" data-end=3D"2678">3.1 Qu'est-ce qu'un S=C3=A9lecteur de Fr=C3=A8res ?=
</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2843" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"2685" data-end=3D"2709">s=C3=A9lecteurs de fr=C3=A8res</strong> permett=
ent de <strong data-start=3D"2724" data-end=3D"2769">cibler un =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ment B qui suit un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment A</strong> sur le m=C3=AAme niveau =
hi=C3=A9rarchique (c'est-=C3=A0-dire qu'ils ont le m=C3=AAme parent).</p>
<p data-start=3D"2845" data-end=3D"2897" class=3D"">Il existe <strong data-=
start=3D"2855" data-end=3D"2869">deux types</strong> de s=C3=A9lecteurs de =
fr=C3=A8res :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2898" data-end=3D"3126">
<li data-start=3D"2898" data-end=3D"3012" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2900" data-end=3D"3012" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
900" data-end=3D"2944">Le s=C3=A9lecteur de fr=C3=A8re adjacent (<code data=
-start=3D"2934" data-end=3D"2941">A + B</code>)</strong> : cible uniquement=
 le premier =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment B qui suit imm=C3=A9diatement A.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3013" data-end=3D"3126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3015" data-end=3D"3126" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
015" data-end=3D"3060">Le s=C3=A9lecteur de fr=C3=A8res g=C3=A9n=C3=A9raux =
(<code data-start=3D"3050" data-end=3D"3057">A ~ B</code>)</strong> : cible=
 <strong data-start=3D"3069" data-end=3D"3077">tous</strong> les =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ments B qui suivent A sur le m=C3=AAme niveau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3128" data-end=3D"3131" class=3D"">
