<ul data-start=3D"602" data-end=3D"812">
<li data-start=3D"602" data-end=3D"637" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"604" data-end=3D"637" class=3D"">Qu'est-ce que <code data-=
start=3D"618" data-end=3D"635">position: fixed</code> ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"638" data-end=3D"672" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"640" data-end=3D"672" class=3D"">Comment l'utiliser effica=
cement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"673" data-end=3D"741" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"675" data-end=3D"741" class=3D"">Les diff=C3=A9rences entr=
e <code data-start=3D"697" data-end=3D"704">fixed</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"706" data-end=3D"716">relative</code>, <code data-start=3D"718" data-en=
d=3D"728">absolute</code> et <code data-start=3D"732" data-end=3D"740">stic=
ky</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"742" data-end=3D"812" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"744" data-end=3D"812" class=3D"">Des exemples pratiques et=
 des astuces pour une utilisation optimale.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"814" data-end=3D"817" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"819" data-end=3D"864" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"82=
1" data-end=3D"864">=F0=9F=93=8C 1. Qu'est-ce que <code data-start=3D"843" =
data-end=3D"860">position: fixed</code> ?</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"866" data-end=3D"1223" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <=
strong data-start=3D"879" data-end=3D"900"><code data-start=3D"881" data-en=
d=3D"898">position: fixed</code></strong> permet de positionner un =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ment par rapport =C3=A0 la fen=C3=AAtre du navigateur (viewport). Con=
trairement aux autres valeurs de positionnement (comme <code data-start=3D"=
1043" data-end=3D"1053">relative</code>, <code data-start=3D"1055" data-end=
=3D"1065">absolute</code>), un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment avec <code data-start=3D"1=
084" data-end=3D"1101">position: fixed</code> reste fix=C3=A9 =C3=A0 sa pos=
ition m=C3=AAme lorsque l'utilisateur fait d=C3=A9filer la page. Autrement =
dit, il ne bouge pas avec le contenu.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1225" data-end=3D"1284" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1229" data-end=3D"1284">Caract=C3=A9ristiques principales de <code data-sta=
rt=3D"1263" data-end=3D"1280">position: fixed</code> :</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1285" data-end=3D"1836">
<li data-start=3D"1285" data-end=3D"1412" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1288" data-end=3D"1412" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
288" data-end=3D"1326">Fix=C3=A9 dans la fen=C3=AAtre du navigateur</strong=
> : L'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment reste visible =C3=A0 l'=C3=A9cran, m=C3=AAme lorsqu=
e l'utilisateur fait d=C3=A9filer la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1575" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1575" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
416" data-end=3D"1455">Positionn=C3=A9 par rapport =C3=A0 la fen=C3=AAtre</=
strong> : Vous pouvez utiliser les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s <code data-start=3D=
"1494" data-end=3D"1499">top</code>, <code data-start=3D"1501" data-end=3D"=
1508">right</code>, <code data-start=3D"1510" data-end=3D"1518">bottom</cod=
e>, et <code data-start=3D"1523" data-end=3D"1529">left</code> pour d=C3=A9=
finir la position exacte de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1718" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1579" data-end=3D"1718" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
579" data-end=3D"1602">Sort du flux normal</strong> : L'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment n=
e prend plus de place dans le flux normal du document. Il se superpose aux =
autres =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1719" data-end=3D"1836" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1722" data-end=3D"1836" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
722" data-end=3D"1758">Peut =C3=AAtre combin=C3=A9 avec <code data-start=3D=
"1747" data-end=3D"1756">z-index</code></strong> : Vous pouvez utiliser <co=
de data-start=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1791">z-index</code> pour contr=C3=B4ler=
 l'ordre des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments empil=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ol>
