<hr data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2080" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"2082" data-end=3D"2130" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2086" data-end=3D"2130">2.2. L'axe principal et l'axe secondaire</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"2132" data-end=3D"2176" class=3D"">Le mod=C3=A8le Flexbox =
fonctionne sur deux axes :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2177" data-end=3D"2478">
<li data-start=3D"2177" data-end=3D"2339" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2339" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
180" data-end=3D"2211">L'axe principal (main axis)</strong> : C'est l'axe s=
uivant lequel les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments flexibles sont dispos=C3=A9s par d=C3=
=A9faut (horizontalement, =C3=A0 moins d'indication contraire).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2478" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2343" data-end=3D"2478" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
343" data-end=3D"2376">L'axe secondaire (cross axis)</strong> : L'axe perpe=
ndiculaire =C3=A0 l'axe principal, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement vertical (si l'ax=
e principal est horizontal).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"2480" data-end=3D"2571" class=3D"">Le comportement de Flex=
box peut =C3=AAtre modifi=C3=A9 en modifiant l'orientation de l'axe princip=
al.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2573" data-end=3D"2576" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"2578" data-end=3D"2618" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2580" data-end=3D"2618">=F0=9F=93=8C 3. Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s du conteneur F=
lex</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"2620" data-end=3D"2753" class=3D"">Les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9=
s suivantes sont appliqu=C3=A9es au conteneur Flex pour contr=C3=B4ler l'al=
ignement et la distribution des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur.=
</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2755" data-end=3D"2784" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2759" data-end=3D"2784">3.1. <code data-start=3D"2766" data-end=3D"2782">fl=
ex-direction</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2786" data-end=3D"2924" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"2799" data-end=3D"2815">flex-direction</code> d=C3=A9fi=
nit la direction principale des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans le conteneur. Elle =
peut avoir quatre valeurs principales :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2925" data-end=3D"3234">
<li data-start=3D"2925" data-end=3D"3005" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2927" data-end=3D"3005" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
927" data-end=3D"2936"><code data-start=3D"2929" data-end=3D"2934">row</cod=
e></strong> (par d=C3=A9faut) : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de gauche =C3=
=A0 droite (horizontale).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3006" data-end=3D"3089" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3008" data-end=3D"3089" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
008" data-end=3D"3025"><code data-start=3D"3010" data-end=3D"3023">row-reve=
rse</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de droite =C3=A0 gauche=
 (horizontal, inverse).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3090" data-end=3D"3153" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3092" data-end=3D"3153" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
092" data-end=3D"3104"><code data-start=3D"3094" data-end=3D"3102">column</=
code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de haut en bas (vertical).</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3234" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3156" data-end=3D"3234" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
156" data-end=3D"3176"><code data-start=3D"3158" data-end=3D"3174">column-r=
everse</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de bas en haut (vert=
ical, inverse).</p>
</li>
</ul>
