<h3 data-start=3D"3386" data-end=3D"3416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3390" data-end=3D"3416">3.2. <code data-start=3D"3397" data-end=3D"3414">ju=
stify-content</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3418" data-end=3D"3611" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"3431" data-end=3D"3448">justify-content</code> permet d=
e d=C3=A9finir comment les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont distribu=C3=A9s sur l'ax=
e principal. Elle ajuste l'espacement entre les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.
Voici les diff=C3=A9rentes valeurs possibles :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3612" data-end=3D"3976">
<li data-start=3D"3612" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
614" data-end=3D"3630"><code data-start=3D"3616" data-end=3D"3628">flex-sta=
rt</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au d=C3=A9but de l'axe p=
rincipal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3682" data-end=3D"3749" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3749" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
684" data-end=3D"3698"><code data-start=3D"3686" data-end=3D"3696">flex-end=
</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =C3=A0 la fin de l'axe pri=
ncipal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3750" data-end=3D"3816" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3752" data-end=3D"3816" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
752" data-end=3D"3764"><code data-start=3D"3754" data-end=3D"3762">center</=
code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au centre de l'axe principal=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3896" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3819" data-end=3D"3896" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
819" data-end=3D"3838"><code data-start=3D"3821" data-end=3D"3836">space-be=
tween</code></strong> : Distribue les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments avec l'espace maxi=
mal entre eux.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3897" data-end=3D"3976" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3899" data-end=3D"3976" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
899" data-end=3D"3917"><code data-start=3D"3901" data-end=3D"3915">space-ar=
ound</code></strong> : Distribue les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments avec un espace =C3=
=A9gal autour d'eux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
