<h3 data-start=3D"4130" data-end=3D"4156" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4134" data-end=3D"4156">3.3. <code data-start=3D"4141" data-end=3D"4154">al=
ign-items</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4158" data-end=3D"4317" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"4171" data-end=3D"4184">align-items</code> contr=C3=B4l=
e l'alignement des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sur l'axe secondaire (vertical, si l'=
axe principal est horizontal). Voici ses valeurs possibles :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4318" data-end=3D"4703">
<li data-start=3D"4318" data-end=3D"4388" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4320" data-end=3D"4388" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
320" data-end=3D"4336"><code data-start=3D"4322" data-end=3D"4334">flex-sta=
rt</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au d=C3=A9but de l'axe s=
econdaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"4457" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4391" data-end=3D"4457" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
391" data-end=3D"4405"><code data-start=3D"4393" data-end=3D"4403">flex-end=
</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =C3=A0 la fin de l'axe sec=
ondaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4458" data-end=3D"4525" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4460" data-end=3D"4525" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
460" data-end=3D"4472"><code data-start=3D"4462" data-end=3D"4470">center</=
code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au centre de l'axe secondair=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4526" data-end=3D"4614" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4528" data-end=3D"4614" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
528" data-end=3D"4542"><code data-start=3D"4530" data-end=3D"4540">baseline=
</code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments selon leur ligne de base (=
utile pour les textes).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4703" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4617" data-end=3D"4703" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
617" data-end=3D"4630"><code data-start=3D"4619" data-end=3D"4628">stretch<=
/code></strong> (par d=C3=A9faut) : =C3=89tire les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments pour =
remplir tout l'espace disponible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
