<p data-start=3D"2505" data-end=3D"2524" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
505" data-end=3D"2522">Explication :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2780">
<li data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2605" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2527" data-end=3D"2605" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
527" data-end=3D"2536"><code data-start=3D"2529" data-end=3D"2534">row</cod=
e></strong> est la valeur par d=C3=A9faut, qui organise les =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nts horizontalement.</p>
