<li data-start=3D"3185" data-end=3D"3280" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
187" data-end=3D"3203"><code data-start=3D"3189" data-end=3D"3201">flex-sta=
rt</code></strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont align=C3=A9s au d=C3=A9but=
 de l'axe principal (valeur par d=C3=A9faut).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3281" data-end=3D"3354" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3283" data-end=3D"3354" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
283" data-end=3D"3297"><code data-start=3D"3285" data-end=3D"3295">flex-end=
</code></strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont align=C3=A9s =C3=A0 la fin d=
e l'axe principal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3418" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3357" data-end=3D"3418" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
357" data-end=3D"3369"><code data-start=3D"3359" data-end=3D"3367">center</=
code></strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont centr=C3=A9s sur l'axe princip=
al.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3419" data-end=3D"3543" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3543" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
421" data-end=3D"3440"><code data-start=3D"3423" data-end=3D"3438">space-be=
tween</code></strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont espac=C3=A9s =C3=A9gale=
ment, avec le premier =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment align=C3=A9 au d=C3=A9but et le der=
nier =C3=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3544" data-end=3D"3649" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3546" data-end=3D"3649" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
546" data-end=3D"3564"><code data-start=3D"3548" data-end=3D"3562">space-ar=
ound</code></strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont espac=C3=A9s =C3=A9galem=
ent, avec un espace =C3=A9gal autour de chaque =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
</ul>
