<p data-start=3D"3249" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
249" data-end=3D"3266">Explication :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3267" data-end=3D"3399">
<li data-start=3D"3267" data-end=3D"3399" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3269" data-end=3D"3399" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"3272" data-end=3D"3283"><code data-start=3D"3274" data-end=3D"3281">.it=
em</code></strong> r=C3=A9tr=C3=A9cira s'il n'y a pas assez d'espace, tandi=
s que <strong data-start=3D"3336" data-end=3D"3349"><code data-start=3D"333=
8" data-end=3D"3347">.item-2</code></strong> ne r=C3=A9tr=C3=A9cira pas =C3=
=A0 cause de <strong data-start=3D"3378" data-end=3D"3398"><code data-start=
=3D"3380" data-end=3D"3396">flex-shrink: 0</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3401" data-end=3D"3404" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"3406" data-end=3D"3430" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3408" data-end=3D"3430">=F0=9F=93=8C 3. <code data-start=3D"3416" data-end=
=3D"3428">flex-basis</code></strong></h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3468" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3436" data-end=3D"3468">Qu'est-ce que <code data-start=3D"3452" data-end=3D=
"3464">flex-basis</code> ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3470" data-end=3D"3727" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<strong data-start=3D"3483" data-end=3D"3499"><code data-start=3D"3485" dat=
a-end=3D"3497">flex-basis</code></strong> d=C3=A9finit la taille initiale d=
'un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment flexible <strong data-start=3D"3549" data-end=3D"3558=
">avant</strong> que l'espace disponible ne soit r=C3=A9parti par <strong d=
ata-start=3D"3603" data-end=3D"3618"><code data-start=3D"3605" data-end=3D"=
3616">flex-grow</code></strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"3622" data-end=3D"=
3639"><code data-start=3D"3624" data-end=3D"3637">flex-shrink</code></stron=
g>. C'est essentiellement la "taille de d=C3=A9part" de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
 avant tout redimensionnement.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3729" data-end=3D"4009">
<li data-start=3D"3729" data-end=3D"3882" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3882" class=3D"">Si un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
 a une valeur <strong data-start=3D"3758" data-end=3D"3774"><code data-star=
t=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3772">flex-basis</code></strong> d=C3=A9finie, cette=
 taille sera utilis=C3=A9e comme r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence avant que le navigateu=
r ne commence =C3=A0 ajuster l'espace.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3883" data-end=3D"4009" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3885" data-end=3D"4009" class=3D"">Si <strong data-start=
=3D"3888" data-end=3D"3904"><code data-start=3D"3890" data-end=3D"3902">fle=
x-basis</code></strong> est d=C3=A9fini =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"3918" =
data-end=3D"3928"><code data-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"3926">auto</code></=
strong> (valeur par d=C3=A9faut), la taille initiale de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
 sera bas=C3=A9e sur son contenu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
