g data-start=3D"5983" data-end=3D"6002">horizontalement</strong> dans le co=
nteneur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6022" data-end=3D"6115" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6024" data-end=3D"6115" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
