de grille avec <strong data-start=3D"6635" data-end=3D"6660"><code data-sta=
rt=3D"6637" data-end=3D"6658">grid-template-areas</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6699" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6665" data-end=3D"6699" class=3D"">Assigner des =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ments =C3=A0 ces zones.</p>
</li>
</ol>
