<h4 data-start=3D"7041" data-end=3D"7059" class=3D"">Explication :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"7060" data-end=3D"7288">
<li data-start=3D"7060" data-end=3D"7168" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7062" data-end=3D"7168" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
062" data-end=3D"7087"><code data-start=3D"7064" data-end=3D"7085">grid-tem=
plate-areas</code></strong> d=C3=A9finit des zones de grille avec des noms =
pour chaque partie de la mise en page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7169" data-end=3D"7288" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7171" data-end=3D"7288" class=3D"">Ensuite, les =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ments <strong data-start=3D"7193" data-end=3D"7205"><code data-start=3D"=
7195" data-end=3D"7203">header</code></strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7207"=
 data-end=3D"7220"><code data-start=3D"7209" data-end=3D"7218">sidebar</cod=
e></strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7222" data-end=3D"7235"><code data-start=
=3D"7224" data-end=3D"7233">content</code></strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"7239" data-end=3D"7251"><code data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7249">foo=
ter</code></strong> sont plac=C3=A9s dans les zones d=C3=A9finies.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7290" data-end=3D"7293" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"7295" data-end=3D"7317" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7297" data-end=3D"7317">=F0=9F=93=8C 8. Conclusion</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"7319" data-end=3D"7595" class=3D"">Le mod=C3=A8le <strong =
data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7341">CSS Grid</strong> est extr=C3=AAmemen=
t puissant pour cr=C3=A9er des mises en page complexes et dynamiques sur le=
 Web. Il permet de g=C3=A9rer facilement la disposition des =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nts =C3=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur d'un conteneur en utilisant des lignes et des c=
olonnes. Voici un r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des concepts cl=C3=A9s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7597" data-end=3D"8014">
<li data-start=3D"7597" data-end=3D"7652" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7599" data-end=3D"7652" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
599" data-end=3D"7618"><code data-start=3D"7601" data-end=3D"7616">display:=
 grid</code></strong> pour activer le mod=C3=A8le de grille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7653" data-end=3D"7761" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7655" data-end=3D"7761" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
655" data-end=3D"7682"><code data-start=3D"7657" data-end=3D"7680">grid-tem=
plate-columns</code></strong> et <strong data-start=3D"7686" data-end=3D"77=
10"><code data-start=3D"7688" data-end=3D"7708">grid-template-rows</code></=
strong> pour d=C3=A9finir la taille des colonnes et des lignes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7762" data-end=3D"7845" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7764" data-end=3D"7845" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
764" data-end=3D"7781"><code data-start=3D"7766" data-end=3D"7779">grid-col=
umn</code></strong> et <strong data-start=3D"7785" data-end=3D"7799"><code =
data-start=3D"7787" data-end=3D"7797">grid-row</code></strong> pour positio=
nner les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans la grille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7846" data-end=3D"7908" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7848" data-end=3D"7908" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
848" data-end=3D"7862"><code data-start=3D"7850" data-end=3D"7860">grid-gap=
</code></strong> pour d=C3=A9finir l'espacement entre les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7909" data-end=3D"8014" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7911" data-end=3D"8014" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
911" data-end=3D"7967">Alignement avec <code data-start=3D"7929" data-end=
=3D"7944">justify-items</code>, <code data-start=3D"7946" data-end=3D"7959"=
>align-items</code>, etc.</strong> pour ajuster les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans=
 leurs cellules.</p>
</li>
