(ligne ou colonne), <strong data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"342">CSS Grid</s=
trong> permet de cr=C3=A9er des mises en page complexes en utilisant =C3=A0=
 la fois des lignes et des colonnes.</p>
<p data-start=3D"440" data-end=3D"568" class=3D"">Dans ce tutoriel, nous al=
lons couvrir la cr=C3=A9ation d'une grille avec <strong data-start=3D"508" =
data-end=3D"520">CSS Grid</strong> en utilisant les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de=
 base suivantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"569" data-end=3D"648">
<li data-start=3D"569" data-end=3D"586" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"586" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"571" =
data-end=3D"586">display: grid</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"587" data-end=3D"612" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"589" data-end=3D"612" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"589" =
data-end=3D"612">grid-template-columns</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"613" data-end=3D"635" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"615" data-end=3D"635" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"615" =
data-end=3D"635">grid-template-rows</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"636" data-end=3D"648" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"638" data-end=3D"648" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"638" =
