</li>
<li data-start=3D"6071" data-end=3D"6151" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6073" data-end=3D"6151" class=3D"">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =
sont organis=C3=A9s dans une grille de <strong data-start=3D"6120" data-end=
=3D"6132">2 lignes</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"6136" data-end=3D"6150=
">3 colonnes</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6152" data-end=3D"6221" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6154" data-end=3D"6221" class=3D"">Il y a un espacement de=
 <strong data-start=3D"6178" data-end=3D"6186">15px</strong> entre chaque =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment de la grille.</p>
</li>
</ul>
