<p data-start=3D"2738" data-end=3D"2961" class=3D"">Dans cet exemple, les =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de la grille sont align=C3=A9s au centre verticalement g=
r=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"2827" data-end=3D"2853"><code data-s=
tart=3D"2829" data-end=3D"2851">align-items: center;</code></strong>. Vous =
pouvez essayer diff=C3=A9rentes valeurs comme <code data-start=3D"2901" dat=
a-end=3D"2908">start</code>, <code data-start=3D"2910" data-end=3D"2915">en=
d</code> ou <code data-start=3D"2919" data-end=3D"2928">stretch</code> pour=
 observer leur comportement.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2963" data-end=3D"2966" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2968" data-end=3D"3040" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"2974" data-end=3D"3040"><code data-start=3D"2976" data-end=3D"2991">jus=
tify-items</code> =E2=80=93 Alignement des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sur l'axe hor=
izontal</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3042" data-end=3D"3277" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<strong data-start=3D"3055" data-end=3D"3074"><code data-start=3D"3057" dat=
a-end=3D"3072">justify-items</code></strong> d=C3=A9finit l'alignement des =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments enfants dans le conteneur de la grille sur l'axe horizon=
tal. Elle permet de contr=C3=B4ler la position des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments par r=
apport =C3=A0 la colonne de la grille (gauche et droite).</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3279" data-end=3D"3321" class=3D"">Valeurs possibles de <=
code data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3319">justify-items</code> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3322" data-end=3D"3676">
<li data-start=3D"3322" data-end=3D"3402" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3324" data-end=3D"3402" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
324" data-end=3D"3335"><code data-start=3D"3326" data-end=3D"3333">start</c=
ode></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au d=C3=A9but du conteneur de=
 la grille (gauche).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3403" data-end=3D"3494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3405" data-end=3D"3494" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
405" data-end=3D"3417"><code data-start=3D"3407" data-end=3D"3415">center</=
code></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments au centre du conteneur de la=
 grille (horizontalement).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3495" data-end=3D"3573" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3497" data-end=3D"3573" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
497" data-end=3D"3506"><code data-start=3D"3499" data-end=3D"3504">end</cod=
e></strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments =C3=A0 la fin du conteneur de l=
a grille (droite).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3574" data-end=3D"3676" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3576" data-end=3D"3676" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
576" data-end=3D"3589"><code data-start=3D"3578" data-end=3D"3587">stretch<=
/code></strong> : Par d=C3=A9faut, les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments s'=C3=A9tirent po=
ur remplir l'espace disponible horizontalement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
