ntre horizontalement, mais vous pouvez =C3=A9galement exp=C3=A9rimenter ave=
c les autres valeurs comme <code data-start=3D"4201" data-end=3D"4208">star=
t</code>, <code data-start=3D"4210" data-end=3D"4215">end</code> ou <code d=
ata-start=3D"4219" data-end=3D"4228">stretch</code> pour en voir l'effet.</=
p>
<hr data-start=3D"4252" data-end=3D"4255" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4335" class=3D"">4. <strong data-start=
=3D"4263" data-end=3D"4335"><code data-start=3D"4265" data-end=3D"4277">ali=
gn-self</code> =E2=80=93 Alignement d'un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment sp=C3=A9cifique =
sur l'axe vertical</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4640" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<strong data-start=3D"4350" data-end=3D"4366"><code data-start=3D"4352" dat=
a-end=3D"4364">align-self</code></strong> permet d'ajuster l'alignement <st=
rong data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4418">d'un seul =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment</str=
ong> sur l'axe vertical, en ignorant l'alignement global d=C3=A9fini par <s=
trong data-start=3D"4482" data-end=3D"4499"><code data-start=3D"4484" data-=
end=3D"4497">align-items</code></strong> sur le conteneur de la grille. Cel=
a donne plus de flexibilit=C3=A9 lorsque vous souhaitez aligner un =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ment d=E2=80=99une mani=C3=A8re diff=C3=A9rente des autres.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4642" data-end=3D"4681" class=3D"">Valeurs possibles de <=
code data-start=3D"4667" data-end=3D"4679">align-self</code> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4995">
<li data-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4749" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4749" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
684" data-end=3D"4695"><code data-start=3D"4686" data-end=3D"4693">start</c=
ode></strong> : Aligne l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment en haut du conteneur de la grill=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4834" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4752" data-end=3D"4834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
752" data-end=3D"4764"><code data-start=3D"4754" data-end=3D"4762">center</=
code></strong> : Aligne l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment au centre verticalement du cont=
eneur de la grille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4835" data-end=3D"4899" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4837" data-end=3D"4899" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
837" data-end=3D"4846"><code data-start=3D"4839" data-end=3D"4844">end</cod=
e></strong> : Aligne l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment en bas du conteneur de la grille.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4900" data-end=3D"4995" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4902" data-end=3D"4995" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
902" data-end=3D"4915"><code data-start=3D"4904" data-end=3D"4913">stretch<=
/code></strong> : Par d=C3=A9faut, l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment s'=C3=A9tire vertica=
lement pour remplir l'espace disponible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
