code></strong> : Aligne l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment au centre horizontalement du co=
nteneur de la grille.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6200" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6202" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
