ansition durera <strong data-start=3D"3581" data-end=3D"3594">1 seconde</st=
rong> lorsque la bo=C3=AEte sera survol=C3=A9e. Une fois la souris retir=C3=
=A9e, la transition reviendra =C3=A9galement sur <strong data-start=3D"3693=
" data-end=3D"3706">1 seconde</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3709" data-end=3D"3712" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3714" data-end=3D"3755" class=3D"">2.3. <strong data-star=
