ansition-timing-function</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3757" data-end=3D"3925" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<strong data-start=3D"3770" data-end=3D"3802"><code data-start=3D"3772" dat=
a-end=3D"3800">transition-timing-function</code></strong> sp=C3=A9cifie le =
type de courbe de vitesse de la transition. Cela contr=C3=B4le la mani=C3=
=A8re dont l'animation =C3=A9volue pendant sa dur=C3=A9e.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3927" data-end=3D"3951" class=3D"">Valeurs possibles :</h=
4>
<ul data-start=3D"3952" data-end=3D"4446">
<li data-start=3D"3952" data-end=3D"4033" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3954" data-end=3D"4033" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
954" data-end=3D"3964"><code data-start=3D"3956" data-end=3D"3962">ease</co=
de></strong> : La vitesse commence lentement, puis acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re et ra=
lentit =C3=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4034" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4036" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
036" data-end=3D"4048"><code data-start=3D"4038" data-end=3D"4046">linear</=
code></strong> : L'animation se fait =C3=A0 une vitesse constante.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4166" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4166" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
098" data-end=3D"4111"><code data-start=3D"4100" data-end=3D"4109">ease-in<=
/code></strong> : L'animation commence lentement et acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re =C3=
=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4167" data-end=3D"4239" class=3D"">
