<hr data-start=3D"3820" data-end=3D"3823" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3865" class=3D"">2.3. <strong data-star=
t=3D"3834" data-end=3D"3865"><code data-start=3D"3836" data-end=3D"3863">an=
imation-timing-function</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3867" data-end=3D"4092" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"3870" data-end=3D"3901"><code data-start=3D"3872" data-end=3D"3899">ani=
mation-timing-function</code></strong> d=C3=A9termine la courbe de vitesse =
de l'animation. Elle contr=C3=B4le la mani=C3=A8re dont l'animation acc=C3=
=A9l=C3=A8re ou ralentit au cours du temps. Il existe plusieurs valeurs pr=
=C3=A9d=C3=A9finies pour cette propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4118" class=3D"">Valeurs possibles :</h=
4>
<ul data-start=3D"4119" data-end=3D"4580">
<li data-start=3D"4119" data-end=3D"4180" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
121" data-end=3D"4133"><code data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4131">linear</=
code></strong> : L'animation se fait =C3=A0 une vitesse constante.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4181" data-end=3D"4271" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4183" data-end=3D"4271" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
183" data-end=3D"4193"><code data-start=3D"4185" data-end=3D"4191">ease</co=
de></strong> : L'animation commence lentement, acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re au milieu=
, puis ralentit =C3=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4272" data-end=3D"4338" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4274" data-end=3D"4338" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
274" data-end=3D"4287"><code data-start=3D"4276" data-end=3D"4285">ease-in<=
/code></strong> : L'animation commence lentement, puis s'acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4339" data-end=3D"4405" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4341" data-end=3D"4405" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
341" data-end=3D"4355"><code data-start=3D"4343" data-end=3D"4353">ease-out=
</code></strong> : L'animation commence rapidement, puis ralentit.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4406" data-end=3D"4503" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4408" data-end=3D"4503" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
408" data-end=3D"4425"><code data-start=3D"4410" data-end=3D"4423">ease-in-=
out</code></strong> : L'animation commence lentement, acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re au=
 milieu, puis ralentit =C3=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4504" data-end=3D"4580" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4506" data-end=3D"4580" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
506" data-end=3D"4540"><code data-start=3D"4508" data-end=3D"4538">cubic-be=
zier(x1, y1, x2, y2)</code></strong> : Une fonction de timing personnalis=
=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
