<p data-start=3D"6740" data-end=3D"6879" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<strong data-start=3D"6753" data-end=3D"6778"><code data-start=3D"6755" dat=
a-end=3D"6776">animation-direction</code></strong> sp=C3=A9cifie si l'anima=
tion doit se d=C3=A9rouler en avant, en arri=C3=A8re ou alterner entre ces =
deux directions.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6881" data-end=3D"6905" class=3D"">Valeurs possibles :</h=
4>
<ul data-start=3D"6906" data-end=3D"7221">
<li data-start=3D"6906" data-end=3D"6978" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6908" data-end=3D"6978" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
908" data-end=3D"6920"><code data-start=3D"6910" data-end=3D"6918">normal</=
code></strong> : L'animation se d=C3=A9roule dans le sens normal (0% =C3=A0=
 100%).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6979" data-end=3D"7053" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6981" data-end=3D"7053" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
981" data-end=3D"6994"><code data-start=3D"6983" data-end=3D"6992">reverse<=
/code></strong> : L'animation se d=C3=A9roule dans l'ordre inverse (100% =
=C3=A0 0%).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7054" data-end=3D"7115" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7056" data-end=3D"7115" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
056" data-end=3D"7071"><code data-start=3D"7058" data-end=3D"7069">alternat=
e</code></strong> : L'animation alterne entre les directions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7116" data-end=3D"7221" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7118" data-end=3D"7221" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
