<h3 data-start=3D"6236" data-end=3D"6253" class=3D"">Explication :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6254" data-end=3D"6654">
<li data-start=3D"6254" data-end=3D"6310" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6256" data-end=3D"6310" class=3D"">Le style par d=C3=A9fau=
t est appliqu=C3=A9 =C3=A0 tous les appareils.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6311" data-end=3D"6487" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6313" data-end=3D"6487" class=3D"">La premi=C3=A8re <stron=
g data-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6340">media query</strong> (<code data-st=
art=3D"6342" data-end=3D"6360">max-width: 768px</code>) est utilis=C3=A9e p=
our les tablettes. Ici, la taille du titre est r=C3=A9duite, et le menu de =
navigation est r=C3=A9organis=C3=A9 en une colonne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6488" data-end=3D"6654" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6490" data-end=3D"6654" class=3D"">La deuxi=C3=A8me <stron=
g data-start=3D"6502" data-end=3D"6517">media query</strong> (<code data-st=
art=3D"6519" data-end=3D"6537">max-width: 480px</code>) cible les appareils=
 mobiles. Elle modifie encore la taille du titre et r=C3=A9organise le menu=
 de mani=C3=A8re plus compacte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"6773" class=3D"">Les media queries perme=
ttent donc de cr=C3=A9er des designs <strong data-start=3D"6711" data-end=
=3D"6736">fluides et adaptatifs</strong> en fonction de la taille de l'=C3=
=A9cran.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6775" data-end=3D"6778" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6780" data-end=3D"6834" class=3D"">5. <strong data-start=
=3D"6786" data-end=3D"6834">Utilisation des Grilles Flexibles et Fluides</s=
trong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6836" data-end=3D"6889" class=3D"">5.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"6845" data-end=3D"6889">Unit=C3=A9s Relatives : <code data-start=3D"68=
66" data-end=3D"6870">em</code>, <code data-start=3D"6872" data-end=3D"6875=
">%</code>, <code data-start=3D"6877" data-end=3D"6881">vw</code>, <code da=
ta-start=3D"6883" data-end=3D"6887">vh</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6891" data-end=3D"7103" class=3D"">Pour rendre le contenu =
fluide, il est important d'utiliser des <strong data-start=3D"6954" data-en=
d=3D"6974">unit=C3=A9s relatives</strong> plut=C3=B4t que des unit=C3=A9s f=
ixes (comme <code data-start=3D"7010" data-end=3D"7014">px</code>), qui ne =
s'ajustent pas aux diff=C3=A9rentes tailles d'=C3=A9crans. Voici quelques u=
nit=C3=A9s utiles :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7105" data-end=3D"7354">
<li data-start=3D"7105" data-end=3D"7178" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7107" data-end=3D"7178" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
107" data-end=3D"7114"><code data-start=3D"7109" data-end=3D"7112">%</code>=
</strong> : Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments utilisent un pourcentage de la taille du=
 parent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7179" data-end=3D"7238" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7181" data-end=3D"7238" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
181" data-end=3D"7189"><code data-start=3D"7183" data-end=3D"7187">em</code=
></strong> et <strong data-start=3D"7193" data-end=3D"7202"><code data-star=
t=3D"7195" data-end=3D"7200">rem</code></strong> : Bas=C3=A9s sur la taille=
 de la police.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7239" data-end=3D"7354" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7354" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
241" data-end=3D"7249"><code data-start=3D"7243" data-end=3D"7247">vw</code=
></strong> et <strong data-start=3D"7253" data-end=3D"7261"><code data-star=
t=3D"7255" data-end=3D"7259">vh</code></strong> : Unit=C3=A9s bas=C3=A9es s=
ur la taille de la fen=C3=AAtre d'affichage (1vw =3D 1% de la largeur de l'=
=C3=A9cran).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7356" data-end=3D"7395" class=3D"">5.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"7365" data-end=3D"7395">Les Flexbox et Grilles CSS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7397" data-end=3D"7649" class=3D"">Pour un agencement flui=
de des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments, <strong data-start=3D"7437" data-end=3D"7448">Fl=
exbox</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"7452" data-end=3D"7464">CSS Grid</s=
trong> sont des outils puissants. Par exemple, Flexbox permet de d=C3=A9fin=
ir un conteneur flexible qui ajuste automatiquement la taille de ses =C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments enfants en fonction de l'espace disponible.</p>
