<h4 data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2343" data-end=3D"2373"><code data-start=3D"2345" data-end=3D"2356">min-wid=
th</code> et <code data-start=3D"2360" data-end=3D"2371">max-width</code></=
strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2375" data-end=3D"2569" class=3D"">Les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9=
s <code data-start=3D"2390" data-end=3D"2401">min-width</code> et <code dat=
a-start=3D"2405" data-end=3D"2416">max-width</code> sont les plus courammen=
t utilis=C3=A9es dans les media queries. Elles permettent de d=C3=A9finir d=
es styles en fonction de la largeur de la fen=C3=AAtre du navigateur.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2571" data-end=3D"2802">
<li data-start=3D"2571" data-end=3D"2686" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2573" data-end=3D"2686" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
573" data-end=3D"2588"><code data-start=3D"2575" data-end=3D"2586">min-widt=
h</code></strong> : Applique les styles si la largeur de l'=C3=A9cran est <=
strong data-start=3D"2640" data-end=3D"2663">sup=C3=A9rieure ou =C3=A9gale<=
/strong> =C3=A0 la valeur sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2687" data-end=3D"2802" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2689" data-end=3D"2802" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
689" data-end=3D"2704"><code data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"2702">max-widt=
h</code></strong> : Applique les styles si la largeur de l'=C3=A9cran est <=
strong data-start=3D"2756" data-end=3D"2779">inf=C3=A9rieure ou =C3=A9gale<=
/strong> =C3=A0 la valeur sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
