<p data-start=3D"3635" data-end=3D"3745" class=3D"">Cela appliquera un fond=
 <strong data-start=3D"3659" data-end=3D"3675">corail clair</strong> lorsqu=
e la largeur de l'=C3=A9cran est comprise entre <strong data-start=3D"3725"=
 data-end=3D"3744">600px et 1024px</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3747" data-end=3D"3750" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3752" data-end=3D"3789" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"3758" data-end=3D"3789">Utilisation des Breakpoints</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3791" data-end=3D"4082" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"3795" data-end=3D"3810">breakpoints</strong> (ou points de rupture) son=
t les tailles d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran =C3=A0 partir desquelles vous souhaitez =
appliquer des modifications de style. Ces points de rupture peuvent =C3=AAt=
re choisis en fonction des appareils ou des r=C3=A9solutions d'=C3=A9cran c=
ourants, ou encore en fonction des besoins du design.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4084" data-end=3D"4129" class=3D"">3.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"4093" data-end=3D"4129">Quand utiliser des breakpoints ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4131" data-end=3D"4393" class=3D"">Vous devez choisir vos =
breakpoints en fonction des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments du design que vous souhaitez=
 adapter. Par exemple, si vous avez un menu de navigation qui doit devenir =
un menu hamburger sur les petits =C3=A9crans, c'est =C3=A0 ce moment-l=C3=
=A0 que vous appliquerez une media query.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4395" data-end=3D"4440" class=3D"">3.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"4404" data-end=3D"4440">Exemples de Breakpoints Courants</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4442" data-end=3D"4515" class=3D"">Voici quelques breakpoi=
nts couramment utilis=C3=A9s pour les tailles d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4517" data-end=3D"4754">
<li data-start=3D"4517" data-end=3D"4561" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4519" data-end=3D"4561" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
519" data-end=3D"4540">Mobile (portrait)</strong> : <code data-start=3D"454=
3" data-end=3D"4561">max-width: 480px</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4562" data-end=3D"4605" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4564" data-end=3D"4605" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
564" data-end=3D"4584">Mobile (paysage)</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4587=
" data-end=3D"4605">max-width: 768px</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4606" data-end=3D"4664" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4608" data-end=3D"4664" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
608" data-end=3D"4621">Tablettes</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4624" data-=
end=3D"4642">min-width: 768px</code> =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"4645" data-=
end=3D"4664">max-width: 1024px</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4665" data-end=3D"4714" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4667" data-end=3D"4714" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
667" data-end=3D"4692">Ordinateurs de bureau</strong> : <code data-start=3D=
"4695" data-end=3D"4714">min-width: 1024px</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4715" data-end=3D"4754" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4717" data-end=3D"4754" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
717" data-end=3D"4732">Grand =C3=A9cran</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4735=
" data-end=3D"4754">min-width: 1200px</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
