<h2 data-start=3D"5004" data-end=3D"5080" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"5010" data-end=3D"5080">CSS Grid : Une Solution Puissante pour les Mise=
s en Page Complexes</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5082" data-end=3D"5334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
082" data-end=3D"5094">CSS Grid</strong> est une autre technique puissante =
pour cr=C3=A9er des mises en page responsives. Contrairement =C3=A0 Flexbox=
, qui est id=C3=A9al pour les mises en page lin=C3=A9aires, Grid permet de =
cr=C3=A9er des mises en page bidimensionnelles, avec des lignes et des colo=
nnes.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5371" class=3D"">3.1. <strong data-star=
t=3D"5345" data-end=3D"5371">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de CSS Grid</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5373" data-end=3D"5729">
<li data-start=3D"5373" data-end=3D"5423" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5375" data-end=3D"5423" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
375" data-end=3D"5394"><code data-start=3D"5377" data-end=3D"5392">display:=
 grid</code></strong> : D=C3=A9finit un conteneur grid.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5488" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5426" data-end=3D"5488" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
426" data-end=3D"5453"><code data-start=3D"5428" data-end=3D"5451">grid-tem=
plate-columns</code></strong> : D=C3=A9finit la largeur des colonnes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5489" data-end=3D"5548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5491" data-end=3D"5548" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
491" data-end=3D"5515"><code data-start=3D"5493" data-end=3D"5513">grid-tem=
plate-rows</code></strong> : D=C3=A9finit la hauteur des lignes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5549" data-end=3D"5618" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5551" data-end=3D"5618" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
551" data-end=3D"5565"><code data-start=3D"5553" data-end=3D"5563">grid-gap=
</code></strong> : D=C3=A9finit l=E2=80=99espace entre les lignes et les co=
lonnes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5619" data-end=3D"5729" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5621" data-end=3D"5729" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
621" data-end=3D"5652"><code data-start=3D"5623" data-end=3D"5636">grid-col=
umn</code> et <code data-start=3D"5640" data-end=3D"5650">grid-row</code></=
strong> : Permet de positionner un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =C3=A0 une position sp=
=C3=A9cifique dans la grille.</p>
</li>
</ul>
