lisateurs qui parlent cette langue.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1642" data-end=3D"1706" class=3D"">1.2. <strong data-star=
t=3D"1651" data-end=3D"1706">Utilisation des balises de sectionnement s=C3=
=A9mantique</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1708" data-end=3D"1922" class=3D"">Les balises s=C3=A9mant=
iques comme <code data-start=3D"1738" data-end=3D"1748">&lt;header&gt;</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"1750" data-end=3D"1760">&lt;footer&gt;</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"1762" data-end=3D"1769">&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code data-star=
t=3D"1771" data-end=3D"1782">&lt;section&gt;</code>, et <code data-start=3D=
"1787" data-end=3D"1798">&lt;article&gt;</code> aident =C3=A0 d=C3=A9finir =
la structure logique de votre page et =C3=A0 renforcer l'importance des sec=
tions pour les moteurs de recherche.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"1924" data-end=3D"1947" class=3D"">Bonnes Pratiques :</h4=
>
<ul data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"2458">
<li data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"2458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"2024" class=3D"">Utilisez des balises s=
=C3=A9mantiques appropri=C3=A9es pour organiser votre contenu.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2027" data-end=3D"2458">
<li data-start=3D"2027" data-end=3D"2115" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2115" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
029" data-end=3D"2043"><code data-start=3D"2031" data-end=3D"2041">&lt;head=
er&gt;</code></strong> : Contient g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement le titre principal=
 de la page et la navigation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2232" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2120" data-end=3D"2232" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
120" data-end=3D"2134"><code data-start=3D"2122" data-end=3D"2132">&lt;foot=
er&gt;</code></strong> : Contient des informations de bas de page comme les=
 mentions l=C3=A9gales, les liens de contact, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2235" data-end=3D"2294" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2237" data-end=3D"2294" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
