</li>
<li data-start=3D"2297" data-end=3D"2396" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2299" data-end=3D"2396" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
299" data-end=3D"2314"><code data-start=3D"2301" data-end=3D"2312">&lt;arti=
cle&gt;</code></strong> : Contient du contenu autonome comme des articles d=
e blog, des publications, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2399" data-end=3D"2458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2401" data-end=3D"2458" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
401" data-end=3D"2416"><code data-start=3D"2403" data-end=3D"2414">&lt;sect=
ion&gt;</code></strong> : Divise un contenu en sections logiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
