<h2 data-start=3D"2929" data-end=3D"3013" class=3D"">2. <strong data-start=
=3D"2935" data-end=3D"3013">Utiliser les Titres (Balises <code data-start=
=3D"2966" data-end=3D"2972">&lt;h1&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"2974" da=
