entaires et les lignes vides.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7763" data-end=3D"7903" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7765" data-end=3D"7903" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
765" data-end=3D"7802">Chargement asynchrone des scripts</strong> : Utilise=
