<h2 data-start=3D"7973" data-end=3D"8023" class=3D"">7. <strong data-start=
=3D"7979" data-end=3D"8023">Optimisation Mobile et Responsive Design</stron=
g></h2>
<p data-start=3D"8025" data-end=3D"8147" class=3D"">Google utilise un mod=
=C3=A8le de "mobile-first" pour indexer les sites. Assurez-vous que votre s=
ite est enti=C3=A8rement responsive.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8149" data-end=3D"8208" class=3D"">7.1. <strong data-star=
