eries</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8210" data-end=3D"8349" class=3D"">Les unit=C3=A9s comme <=
strong data-start=3D"8227" data-end=3D"8235"><code data-start=3D"8229" data=
-end=3D"8233">em</code></strong>, <strong data-start=3D"8237" data-end=3D"8=
246"><code data-start=3D"8239" data-end=3D"8244">rem</code></strong>, <stro=
ng data-start=3D"8248" data-end=3D"8255"><code data-start=3D"8250" data-end=
=3D"8253">%</code></strong> et les <strong data-start=3D"8263" data-end=3D"=
8280">media queries</strong> permettent de rendre un site adaptatif =C3=A0 =
toutes les tailles d'=C3=A9cran.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"8351" data-end=3D"8374" class=3D"">Bonnes Pratiques :</h4=
