get=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"https://cssnano.co/">CSSNano</a> ou <a data=
-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"3957" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D=
"" href=3D"https://www.cleancss.com/">CleanCSS</a> peuvent automatiser ce p=
rocessus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
